 h our booth tour\, you'll also be able to catch a sneak peek at upcoming 
 films with our reel of trailers\, enjoy our snack station\, and more.  Th
 is free event takes place from 3:30–7:30pm\, so come learn about our pr
 ograms\, check out our facilities\, and meet new friends! All are welcome
 .
