SUMMARY:IU Cinema Volunteer Callout Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Curious about volunteering at IU Cinema? Our volunteer callou
 t meeting is the best time to stop by and learn about volunteering\, meet
  fun folks\, grab free pizza\, and maybe even win some prizes! Come by an
 y time from 4-6pm and learn about how our volunteers are able to see grea
 t movies\, get hands-on experience with day-to-day cinema operations\, an
 d spread the word about how much they love IU Cinema!
