SUMMARY:Sirât | Arthouse Now
DESCRIPTION:A father and son searching for their daughter and sister\, wh
 o has seemingly vanished into a traveling rave\, follow her trail deep in
  the mountains of southern Morocco. Surrounded by electronic music and a 
 raw\, unfamiliar sense of freedom\, they hand out her photo again and aga
 in. Hope is fading\, but they follow a group of ravers heading to one las
 t party in the desert. As they venture deeper into the burning wilderness
 \, the journey forces them to confront their own limits. [114 min\; thril
 ler\, drama\; Spanish and French with English subtitles]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  A father and son searching for their da
 ughter and sister\, who has seemingly vanished into a traveling rave\, fo
 llow her trail deep in the mountains of southern Morocco. Surrounded by e
 lectronic music and a raw\, unfamiliar sense of freedom\, they hand out h
 er photo again and again. Hope is fading\, but they follow a group of rav
 ers heading to one last party in the desert. As they venture deeper into 
 the burning wilderness\, the journey forces them to confront their own li
 mits. [114 min\; thriller\, drama\; Spanish and French with English subti
 tles]</p>
