SUMMARY:CatVideoFest 2026 | CINEkids International Children's Film Series
DESCRIPTION:CatVideoFest is a joyous\, communal theatrical experience fea
 turing the latest and best cat videos\, while raising money for cats in n
 eed through partnerships with local charities\, animal welfare organizati
 ons\, and shelters. CatVideoFest is committed to raising awareness and mo
 ney for cats in need all around the world\, and each CVF event's charitab
 le component is local. Since 2019\, CatVideoFest has raised over $1 milli
 on in financial contributions and have facilitated adoptions\, fostering\
 , volunteer sign-ups\, and much more. CatVideoFest is family-friendly and
  can be enjoyed by anyone! [70 min\; comedy\, action\, drama\; English]  
 IU Cinema's CatVideoFest 2026 screening supports the Monroe County Humane
  Association (MCHA). Since 1956\, MCHA has embodied hope and compassion f
 or animals and their human companions throughout Monroe County and its su
 rrounding regions. With a legacy rich in heartfelt service and impactful 
 change spanning more than six decades\, MCHA steadfastly remains a sanctu
 ary of support\, kindness\, and proactive care for animals in their most 
 vulnerable times.  Be a part of CatVideoFest 2026 at IU Cinema by doing o
 ne (or all!) of the following:  1. Want to see your cat on IU Cinema's bi
 g screen? So do we! Submit photos of your feline friends (https://docs.go
 ogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfNBREZeUCSeQNPGQC1MxUg51O9Fwc0c2qmjp01J2P7JQSj
 XA/viewform) by August 19\, and then be sure to arrive early for CatVideo
 Fest 2026 to see patron-submitted cat photos during our pre-screening sli
 deshow!  2. Discover how else you can support MCHA by visiting the Monroe
  County Humane Association website (https://www.monroehumane.org/) and se
 e the myriad ways you can be a part of helping their mission!  3. Get cre
 ative! We will have CatVideoFest coloring pages on hand before our screen
 ing for folks who want to arrive early for some kitty-inspired craft time
 . You can also download CatVideoFest coloring sheets here (https://store.
 oscilloscope.net/products/catvideofest-coloring-pages) and decorate at ho
 me!
