 atrical experience featuring the latest and best cat videos\, while raisi
 ng money for cats in need through partnerships with local charities\, ani
 mal welfare organizations\, and shelters. CatVideoFest is committed to ra
 ising awareness and money for cats in need all around the world\, and eac
 h CVF event's charitable component is local. Since 2019\, CatVideoFest ha
 s raised over $1 million in financial contributions and have facilitated 
 adoptions\, fostering\, volunteer sign-ups\, and much more. CatVideoFest 
 is family-friendly and can be enjoyed by anyone! [70 min\; comedy\, actio
