SUMMARY:The Secret Agent/O Agente Secreto | Arthouse Now
DESCRIPTION:Brazil\, 1977. Marcelo\, a technology expert in his early 40s
 \, is on the run. Hoping to reunite with his son\, he travels to Recife d
 uring Carnival but soon realizes that the city is not the safe haven he w
 as expecting. Winner of Cannes Best Director\, Best Actor\, and FIPRESCI 
 Prize\; nominated for four Academy Awards. [161 min\; drama\, thriller\; 
 Portuguese\, German\, and English with English subtitles]
