DESCRIPTION:One of the earliest films by renowned director Olivier Assaya
 s\, Cold Water depicts troubled and passionate youth in 1970s France. Fea
 turing a memorable soundtrack\, it follows teenage lovers Gilles (Cyprien
  Fouquet) and Christine (Virginie Ledoyen) as they embody a rebellious sp
 irit in an attempt to escape their dysfunctional reality. [95 min\; drama
 \; French with English subtitles]
