 irector Olivier Assayas\, <i>Cold Water</i> depicts troubled and passiona
 te youth in 1970s France. Featuring a memorable soundtrack\, it follows t
 eenage lovers Gilles (Cyprien Fouquet) and Christine (Virginie Ledoyen) a
 s they embody a rebellious spirit in an attempt to escape their dysfuncti
 onal reality. [95 min\; drama\; French with English subtitles]</p>
